  "followNote": "the highlighter stripe under a few words of each section title (.text-highlight::before, a fixed #ffcc00) takes the worn surface: the worn title colour on the yellow read 1.4:1 under Moxie, 2.3:1 under Toggl Track, 3.8:1 under MotherDuck (re-measure 11/10/2026) 20/10/2026 (1.0.3, preview probe v10): Joomla core's .btn-secondary and bare button.btn (the smart search's Advanced Search, the password field's eye, the article pager), which Bootstrap 3 leaves to the browser's button face, take the surface and its text and the accent pair on hover; the badge on the typography page's active list item the surface and its text; Bootstrap's label-primary the accent's own text; the tags page's limit select, Joomla's .inputbox select and AcyMailing's newsletter field the surface, text and line of the system; the typography page's colour swatches, whose words the template leaves to the swatch's own white, take the words of the role each swatch now wears (accent, status, ink): written here, under a system only, so the page with no system is the 1.0.2 sheet declaration for declaration",
