  },
  "maxVersionNote": "1.0.4 20/10/2026: built from 1.0.3 (release-batch.mjs --overlay); the only change is the badge of a Bootstrap 3 status panel heading (.panel-<status> > .panel-heading .badge, 44 rules in 11 bootstrap.css), whose ground reads --ds-c-<status>-text in place of the status fill, the inverted pair of its words (--ds-c-<status>-bg), so its words never read a ground role (TEXT-1); every fallback is the colour 1.0.3 painted, and unworn the page is 1.0.3's (VERIFICATION.json: 0 computed differences desktop and phone, 26/26 pages as released). 1.0.3 20/10/2026: built from 1.0.2 (release-batch.mjs --overlay --replace); every role variable the template paints is read with its own value as the fallback (role scan 0 unresolved), Vietnamese pages use Alegreya in place of Eczar; unworn the page is the release's own (VERIFICATION.json: 0 computed differences desktop and phone, 26/26 pages as released; the screenshots differ only where the home page's Gallery carousel had moved on). 1.0.2 16/10/2026 (#1375): re-cut of 1.0.1 with --move-only: a status colour set as text reads the slot's readable shade (--ds-c-<status>-text); nothing else moved, and unworn the page is the release's own (VERIFICATION.json).",
